  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Grant funding for the Natural Disaster Fund (NDF) Technical Assistance Facility (TAF)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The TAF provides catalytic grants to design and pilot parametric risk transfer products for climate hazard in Vulnerable regions, supporting early-stage product development, innovation, and capacity building - laying the foundation of scalable transactions. The TAF helps unlock risk capacity, address market barriers, protect vulnerable communities, and build a transaction pipeline to grow the parametric insurance market.</narrative>
  </description>
